  "clause_1_scope": "1.1 This part of ISO 1496 specifies the basic specifications and testing requirements for ISO series 1 freight containers of the platform and platformbased types designated 1AA, 1A, 1AX. IBB. IB. 1BX. 1CC, 1C and 1CX which are suitable for international exchange and for conveyance by road, rail and sea, including Interchange between these forms of transport, with certain limitations (for example, when loaded, platforms cannot be stacked or top lifted by means of conventional spreaders) 1,2 The container types covered by this part of ISO 1496 are given in table 1 Table 1 — Container types Type Type code d«slgnatlon^> Platform With Incomplete superstructure with fixed complete end structure with fixed free-standing posts with folding complete end structure with folding free-standing posts with roof with open top with open top, open ends (skeletal) 60 61 62 63 64 65 66 67 1) In accordance with ISO 6346.",
